Task: Perform a deep analysis of the following job posting.

Classification Rules:
1. The "category" MUST be exactly one of: <%= JobBoards::Categorizer::CATEGORIES.join(', ') %>.
2. The "tags" should be 1-5 technical keywords.

Remote Analysis Rules:
1. "is_remote": Set to true ONLY if the role is 100% remote. Set to false if it mentions "hybrid", "on-site", or "relocation required".
2. "remote_nuance": A brief summary of the remote policy (e.g., "Worldwide", "US Only", "Hybrid - 3 days in office", "Digital Nomad Friendly").

Salary Extraction Rules:
1. "salary_min": The lowest annual salary mentioned (as a whole integer). Null if not found.
2. "salary_max": The highest annual salary mentioned (as a whole integer). Null if not found.
3. "currency": The currency code (e.g., "USD", "EUR", "GBP").

Return ONLY valid JSON. No preamble, no explanation.

Expected JSON Format:
{
  "category": "Software Engineering",
  "tags": ["ruby", "rails"],
  "is_remote": true,
  "remote_nuance": "US Only",
  "salary_min": 140000,
  "salary_max": 180000,
  "currency": "USD"
}
